  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rapid Stabilisation Support and Early Recovery Initiative (RSS-ERI)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the Rapid Stabilisation Support and Early Recovery Initiative (RSS-ERI) is to address the complex challenges of stabilization and recovery. The project aims to support with stabilisation newly liberated areas from the terror organisation Al-shabab.  The project is funded by Danish MFA (ODA funding) and FCDO (non-ODA funding) and implemented by the International Organization for Migration (IOM) alongside formal and informal civil society actors, and dispute resolution institutions.</narrative>
  </description>
